09090b]"><div class="absolute top-0 right-4 -translate-y-1/2"><div class="px-3 py-0.5 text-xs bg-[#09090b] text-white border border-[#09090b]">Most Popular</div></div><h3 class="text-sm font-heading mb-1.5 text-[#09090b]">Startup</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#78716c] leading-relaxed mb-3 min-h-10">For teams scaling browser agents in production.</p><div class="mb-3"><div class="text-2xl font-heading text-[#09090b] inline-flex items-baseline gap-1"><span>$100</span><span class="text-xs font-sans font-light text-[#78716c]">/mo</span></div></div><div class="border-y border-[#d6d3d1] py-3 mb-4"><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] font-medium">$100 credits / mo</div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c] mt-0.5">Monthly credits expire each cycle.</div></div><div class="space-y-1.5 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser concurrency<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->100</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Agents / functions<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->100 concurrent</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">BYO<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Keys, proxies</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Session duration<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->300 min</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="https://console.notte.cc/signin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full border py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors group flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-[#09090b] text-white border-[#09090b] hover:bg-[#09090b]/80">Sign Up<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="relative border px-4 py-5 flex flex-col bg-white border-[#d6d3d1]"><h3 class="text-sm font-heading mb-1.5 text-[#09090b]">Enterprise</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#78716c] leading-relaxed mb-3 min-h-10">For custom limits, compliance, and support.</p><div class="mb-3"><div class="text-2xl font-heading text-[#09090b] inline-flex items-baseline gap-1"><span>Custom</span></div></div><div class="border-y border-[#d6d3d1] py-3 mb-4"><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] font-medium">Custom credits</div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c] mt-0.5">Commercial terms matched to usage.</div></div><div class="space-y-1.5 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser concurrency<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Custom</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">BYO<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Keys, Proxies, Cloud</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">More<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->SSO, SLAs, HIPAA</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="https://cal.com/team/notte/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full border py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors group flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-transparent text-[#09090b] border-[#d6d3d1] hover:border-[#09090b]">Book a demo<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-notte-600">Core features, including proxies, vaults, personas, sessions, functions, and agents, are available across plans. Plans mainly change credits and operational limits.</p></div><div id="rate-limits" class="mt-10 scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl/8 font-heading font-normal tracking-tight text-[#09090b] leading-[1.1] mb-5">Detailed pricing and rate limits</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1.55fr)] gap-3 lg:items-stretch"><div class="border border-[#d6d3d1] bg-white"><div class="h-10 px-4 border-b border-[#d6d3d1] flex items-center"><h3 class="text-sm font-heading text-[#09090b]">Usage pricing</h3></div><div class="divide-y divide-[#e7e5e4]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser sessions</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$0.01 / hour</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Rounded according to the billing policy.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser functions</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$0.05 / hour</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Rounded according to the billing policy.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Residential proxies</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$10 / GB</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Billed only when proxies are enabled.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Bring your own proxy</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$0.20 / GB</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Startup plan. Traffic through your own proxy is billed for bandwidth only, not at the residential proxy rate.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">LLM tokens</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">Token price</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">No Notte markup when using Notte-managed keys. Bring your own keys on supported plans.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Free credits</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$10 once</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Non-expiring top-up balance for new accounts.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Monthly plan credits</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">$20 or $100 / mo</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Subscription credits refresh monthly and expire each cycle.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.82fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-1.5 sm:gap-3 px-4 py-2.5"><div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Manual top-ups</div><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">Available</div></div><p class="text-xs text-notte-600 leading-relaxed">Extra purchased credits sit outside monthly plan credits and do not expire.</p></div></div></div><div class="border border-[#d6d3d1] bg-white overflow-x-auto"><div role="table" aria-label="Plan rate limits" class="h-full min-w-[620px] flex flex-col text-left"><div role="row" class="grid h-10 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] border-b border-[#d6d3d1]"><div role="columnheader" class="px-4 text-xs font-normal text-[#78716c] flex items-center">Limit</div><div role="columnheader" class="px-4 text-xs font-normal text-[#78716c] flex items-center">Free</div><div role="columnheader" class="px-4 text-xs font-normal text-[#78716c] flex items-center">Developer</div><div role="columnheader" class="px-4 text-xs font-normal text-[#78716c] flex items-center">Startup</div><div role="columnheader" class="px-4 text-xs font-normal text-[#78716c] flex items-center">Enterprise</div></div><div role="rowgroup" class="flex flex-1 flex-col divide-y divide-[#e7e5e4]"><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Browser concurrency</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">5</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">25</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">100</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Custom</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Agents / functions concurrency</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">5</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">25</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">100</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Custom</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Vaults</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">5</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">50</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">200</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Custom</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Personas</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">5</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">50</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">200</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Custom</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Max session duration</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">15 min</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">120 min</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">300 min</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Custom</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Bring your own keys</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Yes</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Yes</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Bring your own proxy</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Yes, $0.20 / GB</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Yes</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">Captcha solving / stealth</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Included</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Included</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Included</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Targeted</div></div><div role="row" class="grid flex-1 grid-cols-[minmax(220px,1.4fr)_repeat(4,minmax(90px,0.7fr))] items-center min-h-[48px]"><div role="rowheader" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs font-normal text-notte-600">On-premise deployment</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">No</div><div role="cell" class="px-4 py-3 text-xs text-[#09090b]">Available</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer id="app-footer" class="w-full py-12 md:py-16 px-4 z-50 relative text-white border-white/10 transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-100 bg-black border-t-0"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-12 mb-8"><div class="lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-6"><a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="95 90 1404 334" fill="none" class="h-8 w-auto text-white"><path d="M778.08 114.2V383H746.976L603.36 163.352V383H572.64V114.2H603.744L747.36 333.464V114.2H778.08ZM923.262 385.688C905.086 385.688 888.83 381.72 874.494 373.784C860.158 365.848 848.894 354.584 840.702 339.992C832.51 325.144 828.414 307.608 828.414 287.384C828.414 266.904 832.51 249.24 840.702 234.392C849.15 219.544 860.542 208.152 874.878 200.216C889.47 192.28 905.854 188.312 924.03 188.312C942.206 188.312 958.462 192.28 972.798 200.216C987.39 208.152 998.782 219.544 1006.97 234.392C1015.42 248.984 1